OL,3,GNEWSADartmoor ponies support
OL,4,Abiodiversity through grazing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "mosaic" grazing patterns of
OL,7,FDartmoor ponies have driven ecological
OL,8,Fchange and increased habitat diversity,
OL,9,Fa new photographic study has found.
OL,11,FRepeatedly returning to the same areas,
OL,12,Fthe ponies have prevented the growth of
OL,13,Frestrictive grass species, allowing
OL,14,Fother plants to establish on the
OL,15,Fmoorland.
OL,17,FThe ponies grazing at Bellever have
OL,18,Fleft visible changes on the Devon
OL,19,Flandscape, whilst supporting habitat
OL,20,Fdiversity.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
