OL,3,GNEWSADartmoor ponies support
OL,4,Abiodiversity through grazing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhotographer Malcolm Snelgrove, who has
OL,7,Fbeen studying the herd, said: "The
OL,8,Fevidence is already written into the
OL,9,Flandscape. The paths cut through the
OL,10,Fgrass. The changes in structure. The
OL,11,Freturn of heather."
